{"text": "Mrs Hasmik lives next door to Ani. She is very old, and she lives alone with her grey cat. One cold afternoon, Ani sees her on the stairs with two heavy bags. 'Let me help you,' says Ani, and she carries the bags up to the third floor. Mrs Hasmik is very happy. She invites Ani in for tea and tells her stories about Yerevan when she was a little girl. Now Ani visits her every Friday, and they are good friends.", "words": [[0.34, 0.56], [0.82, 1.38], [1.54, 1.78], [1.84, 2.16], [2.22, 2.44], [2.56, 2.66], [2.82, 3.08], [4.34, 4.44], [4.54, 4.64], [4.72, 4.98], [5.16, 5.48], [5.88, 5.98], [6.04, 6.14], [6.24, 6.48], [6.54, 6.96], [7.02, 7.16], [7.2, 7.3], [7.38, 7.58], [7.7, 8.08], [9.36, 9.52], [9.6, 9.92], [10.0, 10.66], [11.12, 11.32], [11.5, 11.76], [11.8, 11.9], [11.96, 12.04], [12.06, 12.16], [12.24, 12.72], [12.8, 12.94], [13.06, 13.28], [13.38, 13.6], [13.7, 14.2], [14.4, 15.5], [15.58, 15.64], [15.78, 16.02], [16.12, 16.56], [16.7, 16.92], [17.0, 17.24], [17.8, 17.92], [17.98, 18.06], [18.16, 18.56], [18.62, 18.7], [18.78, 19.22], [19.32, 19.42], [19.5, 19.56], [19.62, 19.7], [19.78, 20.06], [20.16, 20.48], [21.64, 21.86], [22.12, 22.66], [22.76, 22.88], [22.98, 23.24], [23.4, 23.72], [24.94, 25.04], [25.14, 25.68], [25.8, 26.02], [26.12, 26.22], [26.32, 26.46], [26.52, 26.78], [27.06, 27.18], [27.24, 27.56], [27.6, 27.7], [27.78, 28.32], [28.38, 28.66], [28.74, 29.3], [29.44, 29.58], [29.68, 29.76], [29.82, 29.96], [30.0, 30.03], [30.08, 30.38], [30.44, 30.78], [32.0, 32.22], [32.32, 32.54], [32.7, 33.12], [33.16, 33.3], [33.46, 33.7], [33.82, 34.36], [34.78, 34.9], [34.92, 35.04], [35.1, 35.22], [35.26, 35.42], [35.52, 36.206]], "tag": "en-GB-SoniaNeural", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}